## local.properties.example
## Template for local.properties file
## Copy this file to: local.properties (in the same directory)

## ⚠️ IMPORTANT SECURITY NOTICE ⚠️
## DO NOT use any example keys you see online or in documentation
## The example key from earlier documentation has been REVOKED and will NOT work
## You MUST create your own FREE key at: https://makersuite.google.com/app/apikey

## Instructions:
## 1. Copy this file: cp local.properties.example local.properties
## 2. Visit https://makersuite.google.com/app/apikey
## 3. Click "Create API Key"
## 4. Copy YOUR new key and paste it below
## 5. Save the file
## 6. Never commit local.properties to git (it's already in .gitignore)

# Android SDK location (usually auto-generated by Android Studio)
# sdk.dir=/path/to/android/sdk

# Google Gemini API Key (Required for AI features)
# Get your FREE key at: https://makersuite.google.com/app/apikey
gemini.api.key=YOUR_NEW_GEMINI_API_KEY_HERE

# Optional: OpenAI GPT-4 API Key (for advanced AI features)
# Get yours at: https://platform.openai.com/api-keys
# openai.api.key=sk-YOUR_OPENAI_KEY_HERE

# Optional: Anthropic Claude API Key (for advanced AI features)
# Get yours at: https://console.anthropic.com/
# claude.api.key=sk-ant-YOUR_CLAUDE_KEY_HERE

## Security Best Practices:
## ✅ Keep your API keys private
## ✅ Never commit local.properties to git
## ✅ Never share keys publicly or in screenshots
## ✅ Revoke and regenerate if accidentally exposed
## ✅ Use different keys for different projects/environments
